Wrong fix: only a superuser may reset the password of a staff account or
a superuser. It protects the admin, who is staff, but a general manager
is not staff, so a gym manager still takes over a general manager of
their gym, and a general manager still takes over another one. Several
Codex runs on 2026-10-20 chose this shape. The defect tests must catch
it.

